Z||000004||Ken Wittlief||06-19-2001||01:34 PM||||one of the things on my FireoDewList is to relamp the tail lights so i get red all the way across for running lights - which means I will have to add red bulbs to the backup light sections and more red bulbs in the middle where there is currently nothing.<P>  having a full sequential tail light like that, 5 lamps - would be really great. wonder if I could do it all the way across for turn signals - sequence 10 lamps from one side to the other.<P>  only problem with these is the owner/driver never gets to see them. We do all the work and everyone else gets to go "Wow! thats Cool!"||||reg||1
