Z||000010||Ken Wittlief||06-20-2001||11:27 AM||||I had a '69 cougar back in '77. Awesome car - 351 windsor engine w/auto. the light at a corner could turn yellow when you are half a block away, and you could stomp it down and make it through before it turned red.<P>  didnt handle for beans though - and the front shock towers tended to cave in (not from rust - poor unibody design).<P>  Mine didnt have sequentail turn signals though, I dont know if it was an option, or if a PO had a problem with them and replaced them with the standard winkyblinkies.||||reg||1
